LibreHardwareMonitor
  https://github.com/LibreHardwareMonitor/LibreHardwareMonitor
  Licensed under the Mozilla Public License 2.0.
  IT8655E register addresses, the bank-select fix for issue #780, and the PawnIO
  ioctl interface were taken from its source as reference. The ITE IT86xx/IT87xx
  and Nuvoton NCT677x/NCT679x chip IDs, register maps (fan, PWM, tachometer,
  temperature source and bank-select registers) and decoding rules in
  crates/hw/src/chips.rs, crates/hw/src/ite.rs and crates/hw/src/nuvoton.rs
  were ported from LibreHardwareMonitorLib/Hardware/Motherboard/Lpc/IT87XX.cs,
  Nct677X.cs, LpcIO.cs and LpcPort.cs. No files were copied. Those three
