Linux k10temp driver
  https://github.com/torvalds/linux/blob/master/drivers/hwmon/k10temp.c
  Reference for AMD family 17h/19h/1Ah temperature register decoding and the
  per-model CCD temperature layouts. No code was copied.

ryzen_monitor
  https://github.com/hattedsquirrel/ryzen_monitor
  Reference for the per-core temperature (CORE_TEMP) positions in the AMD SMU
  PM table versions listed in crates/hw/src/smu.rs. No code was copied.

Linux nct6775 driver
  https://github.com/torvalds/linux/blob/master/drivers/hwmon/nct6775-core.c
  Reference for the Nuvoton temperature source numbers (SMBus master, PECI,
  PCH and DIMM sources) in crates/hw/src/chips.rs, cross-checked with
  LibreHardwareMonitor where it lists them, and for the fan and PWM pin
  selection rules in crates/hw/src/pinmux.rs (nct6775-platform.c). No code was
  copied.

Linux it87 driver (mainline and frankcrawford/it87)
  https://github.com/torvalds/linux/blob/master/drivers/hwmon/it87.c
  https://github.com/frankcrawford/it87
  Reference for the ITE PWM configuration check and the fan and PWM pin
  selection rules in crates/hw/src/pinmux.rs. No code was copied.

Linux nct6687d driver (out of tree)
  https://github.com/Fred78290/nct6687d
  Reference for the NCT6683D/NCT6686D/NCT6687D embedded-controller registers,
  the MSI board layouts and the fan configuration handshake. No code was copied.

Linux coretemp driver
  https://github.com/torvalds/linux/blob/master/drivers/hwmon/coretemp.c
  Reference for Intel digital thermal sensor and TjMax decoding. No code was
  copied.

